      "side": 1,
      "message": "While it\u0027s no sm8650, it\u0027s not a feature port. The new blair runs on (6.1.128) and shares hals common to pineapple and volcano. 5.4 -\u003e 6.1 is a facelift for old holi -\u003e blair devices. So, from previous lahaina (SM8350) -\u003e pineapple base(SM8650)  which should regardless place blair under UM_6_1_FAMILY\n\nDisplay stack HIDL -\u003e AIDL, including demura \nAGM and AR-PAL audio stack fully supported\nThermal netlink fwk now supported.\n\n\nAs far as I can tell, the Tab A9+ is the only device to benefit from the new platform for now.\n@NikitaSavc@yandex.ru\n\n[1] https://gitlab.com/clexan/android_firmware_dump-gta9pwifi\n[2] https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/la/platform/vendor/qcom/blair/-/blob/qcom-devices.lnx.16.0.r3-rel/BoardConfig.mk?ref_type\u003dheads#L32",
